<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:06.800" end="00:00:10.000" style="s2">MY DAUGHTER IS DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.200" end="00:00:13.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M NOT DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.300" end="00:00:17.200" style="s2">DADDY, EAT.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:20.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.200" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, your little frog.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.200" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">Empty tummy, sad heart.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.700" end="00:00:28.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let you in?</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:28.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I&#39;m very sorry. She slipped out of</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.000" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">the visitors&#39; room.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.700" end="00:00:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.800" end="00:00:33.000" style="s2">you can&#39;t run off like that.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.100" end="00:00:37.000" style="s2">Mr. Hawthorn, we believe Poppy may be</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:38.500" style="s2">your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:40.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.500" end="00:00:41.800" style="s2">My wife and daughter died two years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.100" end="00:00:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was an error in the records. Poppy</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.800" end="00:00:46.000" style="s2">was listed under her mother&#39;s last name.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.600" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re saying she&#39;s alive?</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.000" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The records suggest she is. We&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:54.000" style="s2">waiting on the DNA results.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.100" end="00:00:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, your hands are cold.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.600" end="00:01:02.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.900" end="00:01:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.700" end="00:01:07.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.199" end="00:01:07.000" style="s2">That&#39;s Claire&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:12.600" style="s2">The DNA results come back tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.800" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">morning. Until then, her placement still</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.600" end="00:01:18.200" style="s2">needs approval.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.100" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are you really my daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.200" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">Can I stay with you tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.500" end="00:01:28.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, she needs to go back to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.600" end="00:01:31.300" style="s2">children&#39;s home for now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.000" end="00:01:32.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I just found my daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.300" end="00:01:34.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy&#39;s identity is pretty much</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.600" end="00:01:36.200" style="s2">confirmed, but custody changes take</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.900" end="00:01:38.500" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.200" end="00:01:40.400" style="s2">She should go back tonight. Once the DNA</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.500" end="00:01:42.500" style="s2">results and home assessment are done, we</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.400" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">can arrange visits. She&#39;s too little.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.500" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">The west wing is no place for a child.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.600" end="00:01:49.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this house isn&#39;t childproof yet.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:52.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.400" end="00:01:52.900" style="s2">I do tiny ribbies.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.600" end="00:02:01.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:03.892" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s not leaving you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.000" end="00:02:06.292" style="s2">You just to go back for one night.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.892" end="00:02:09.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time they said just one night, then</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.292" end="00:02:11.192" style="s2">I woke up and it wasn&#39;t home anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.392" end="00:02:12.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s been moved before?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:14.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy was relocated several times due to</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.992" end="00:02:15.592" style="s2">paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.292" end="00:02:17.192" style="s2">She&#39;s too young to understand our</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.592" end="00:02:19.092" style="s2">temporarily.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.192" end="00:02:21.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you&#39;re in no condition to</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.092" end="00:02:22.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know exactly where I stand.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.692" end="00:02:25.692" style="s2">Let her stay</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.992" end="00:02:26.792" style="s2">starting tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.692" end="00:02:28.092" style="s2">This house takes daily family</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.792" end="00:02:32.192" style="s2">observation,</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.092" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">doctors, social workers, safety checks,</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.192" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">whatever you need.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.892" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:41.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get a room ready.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.492" end="00:02:43.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can stay?</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.692" end="00:02:44.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When your tummy is empty, your heart</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.092" end="00:02:45.592" style="s2">feels empty too.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.492" end="00:02:47.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yay!</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.592" end="00:02:49.092" style="s2">I can stay!</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.392" end="00:02:51.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No child has ever come into this house</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.092" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">like that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.492" end="00:02:57.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can wash the mud off.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.592" end="00:02:57.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The carpet can be replaced. She can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.392" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">Can</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.992" end="00:03:23.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, why you got so many black</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:25.492" style="s2">clothes? Does it rain on you every day?</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.692" end="00:03:27.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dinner is ready, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.492" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s eat first. The rain will get</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.892" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">smaller once you&#39;re full.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.692" end="00:03:35.692" style="s2">Not yummy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.692" end="00:03:40.692" style="s2">Why so little?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.992" end="00:03:50.992" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.192" end="00:03:54.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, this is organic pumpkin soup.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.992" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, you eating?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.092" end="00:03:58.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:04:02.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got to eat a little. Martha says little</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.992" end="00:04:02.594" style="s2">froggies need strong tummies for winter.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.492" end="00:04:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.594" end="00:04:05.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.894" end="00:04:09.094" style="s2">Mr. Hawthorn doesn&#39;t like being</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.494" end="00:04:09.094" style="s2">disturbed during meals.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.094" end="00:04:16.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, sit up straight, use your knife</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.494" end="00:04:16.794" style="s2">and fork, and don&#39;t play with your food.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.294" end="00:04:23.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, the kitchen isn&#39;t a playroom.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.494" end="00:04:44.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy food, froggy food knows me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.794" end="00:04:46.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bread was dough for tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.194" end="00:04:46.694" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.894" end="00:04:52.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy eats froggy, Daddy goes ribbit.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.794" end="00:05:05.494" style="s2">Daddy, can you croak like a frog now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:05.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.694" end="00:05:08.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quack, quack.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.494" end="00:05:13.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur, have the kitchen make something</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.294" end="00:05:13.294" style="s2">knows her from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.994" end="00:05:20.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yay, froggy food forever.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.994" end="00:05:24.394" style="s2">Daddy, you ate. When your tummy is</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.094" end="00:05:24.394" style="s2">empty, your heart feels empty, too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.494" end="00:05:29.594" style="s2">Daddy, the sun is knocking.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.994" end="00:05:35.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell it I&#39;m not seeing anyone today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.494" end="00:05:46.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s tied up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.294" end="00:05:46.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.994" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.894" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like sunlight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.594" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy want to get moldy?</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.694" end="00:06:01.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.094" end="00:06:03.694" style="s2">you can &#39;t speak to Mr. Hawthorn like</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.494" end="00:06:06.395" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.694" end="00:06:08.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only in dark places.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.395" end="00:06:09.095" style="s2">Mushrooms like it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.195" end="00:06:10.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.095" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">stay away from the window.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.895" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only a little sun comes in.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.295" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">Is it not okay?</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.595" end="00:06:44.195" style="s2">Can&#39;t pull the curtain. I&#39;m going to go</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.095" end="00:06:45.795" style="s2">open the window.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.195" end="00:06:47.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, chairs are for sitting, not</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.795" end="00:06:49.995" style="s2">climbing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.795" end="00:06:52.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not climbing the window.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.995" end="00:06:52.895" style="s2">I&#39;m saving the sun.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.295" end="00:06:58.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hawthorn&#39;s there. She&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.304" end="00:07:14.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.995" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s so fast.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.995" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">Froggy wants to see the sun, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">Daddy came into the sunshine, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.195" end="00:07:28.895" style="s2">Daddy, look.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.295" end="00:07:34.295" style="s2">There&#39;s a real frog outside.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.695" end="00:07:46.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.495" end="00:07:53.395" style="s2">Please stay away from the fountain.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.695" end="00:07:53.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t have an appointment.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.195" end="00:07:57.495" style="s2">But it came in anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.995" end="00:08:03.095" style="s2">Daddy, come down. The froggy wants to</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.395" end="00:08:03.095" style="s2">meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.995" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">If daddy is not coming,</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.097" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">I&#39;m not going back either.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.697" end="00:08:17.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, the ground is cold. Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.897" end="00:08:20.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Daddy doesn&#39;t come, I&#39;m staying with</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:20.597" style="s2">the froggy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.297" end="00:08:25.097" style="s2">Careful, it&#39;s a guest.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.797" end="00:08:34.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you&#39;re going outside.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.145" end="00:08:39.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.497" end="00:08:43.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy came out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.797" end="00:08:43.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Go back inside.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.897" end="00:08:53.797" style="s2">Take it away.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.097" end="00:08:55.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s scared too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.797" end="00:08:58.997" style="s2">Daddy, don&#39;t be scary.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.997" end="00:09:02.397" style="s2">Make your hand a little bowl,</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.997" end="00:09:02.397" style="s2">not a pinchy thing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.397" end="00:09:07.697" style="s2">Daddy caught it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.697" end="00:09:25.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We must deny the child&#39;s identity.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.597" end="00:09:26.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, she&#39;s my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.926" end="00:09:28.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.797" end="00:09:29.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hawthorn, your personal life has</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.497" end="00:09:31.297" style="s2">always been in the spotlight. Now a</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.797" end="00:09:32.897" style="s2">child shows up out of nowhere. People</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.297" end="00:09:34.497" style="s2">are going to ask a lot more questions.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.897" end="00:09:37.597" style="s2">We suggest saying she&#39;s just a kid</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:37.597" style="s2">you&#39;re looking after for now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.797" end="00:09:45.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, they don&#39;t like me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.097" end="00:09:48.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, if you claim her in public,</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.897" end="00:09:49.697" style="s2">everything gets messy. The guardianship,</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">the media, the last two years, they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.697" end="00:09:53.297" style="s2">dig into all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.997" end="00:09:55.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Miss Poppy is only four. Putting</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.297" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">her in the press isn&#39;t fair to her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.597" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hide.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.331" end="00:10:01.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.497" end="00:10:06.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Set up a press conference.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.897" end="00:10:06.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.597" end="00:10:10.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t make my daughter hide.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.797" end="00:10:12.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.098" end="00:10:14.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hawthorn, who is this child?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.998" end="00:10:14.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she related to your late wife,</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.298" end="00:10:16.298" style="s2">Claire?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.798" end="00:10:18.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you in any position to be a father</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:18.698" style="s2">right now?</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.698" end="00:10:27.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name is Mr. Ribbit. He doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.698" end="00:10:27.098" style="s2">answer grown-up questions.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.398" end="00:10:35.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name is Poppy Hawthorn.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.398" end="00:10:35.198" style="s2">She is my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.698" end="00:10:40.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hawthorn, are you ready to be a real</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:40.298" style="s2">father?</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.498" end="00:10:47.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He already is.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.798" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">Daddy, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.398" end="00:11:01.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To work.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.698" end="00:11:01.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;m going to work too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.698" end="00:11:07.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.998" end="00:11:09.898" style="s2">Mr. Hawthorn will be back tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.298" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight is so far away. If Daddy goes</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.898" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">out, will he forget to come back?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.798" end="00:11:20.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prepare the child safety seat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.498" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re taking her to the board</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.698" end="00:11:24.698" style="s2">meeting?</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.598" end="00:11:24.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She says she&#39;s going to work too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.998" end="00:11:37.298" style="s2">Let&#39;s continue.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.998" end="00:11:37.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At work, rules come first.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.298" end="00:11:39.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rules?</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.998" end="00:11:42.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No yelling at Daddy, no making Daddy</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.598" end="00:11:42.898" style="s2">skip meals, no taking away my Froggy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.168" end="00:11:44.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.898" end="00:11:46.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hawthorn, we&#39;re here to discuss the</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.398" end="00:11:50.498" style="s2">quarterly budget today.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.898" end="00:11:50.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meetings make you hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.198" end="00:11:56.698" style="s2">I will behave. Froggy did well late.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.698" end="00:11:57.998" style="s2">Miss Poppy&#39;s right. Just give Froggy a</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.698" end="00:12:00.998" style="s2">get Froggy</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.998" end="00:12:03.998" style="s2">Froggy&#39;s turn to speak. But Froggy says</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.998" end="00:12:03.998" style="s2">one at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.398" end="00:12:09.498" style="s2">Daddy did well at work. Reward.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.498" end="00:12:16.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Poppy, what are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.499" end="00:12:20.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a crying daddy over there.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.199" end="00:12:26.299" style="s2">Daddy, if you cry, you can hold this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.899" end="00:12:34.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.399" end="00:12:43.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are you listening to the wind</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.399" end="00:12:46.899" style="s2">cry?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.799" end="00:12:46.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, go back inside.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.499" end="00:12:52.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Martha says you can hold it when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.299" end="00:12:52.899" style="s2">scared.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.099" end="00:12:58.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not scared.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.699" end="00:12:58.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then are you missing mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.499" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">Daddy, you hold it. I still got Froggy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.799" end="00:13:16.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I miss her</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.834" end="00:13:18.599" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.499" end="00:13:21.099" style="s2">a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.599" end="00:13:23.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.099" end="00:13:24.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you remember mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.199" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.499" end="00:13:29.599" style="s2">She smelled nice.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.099" end="00:13:29.599" style="s2">She sang the Froggy song.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.199" end="00:13:34.799" style="s2">Daddy cries. Daddy needs water.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.599" end="00:13:39.299" style="s2">This stone is for daddy to think of</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.699" end="00:13:40.399" style="s2">mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.299" end="00:13:42.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.399" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">what if daddy still gets sad sometimes?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.699" end="00:13:46.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll be sad with you for a little</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:46.899" style="s2">while.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.899" end="00:13:57.799" style="s2">The carpet grew feet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.799" end="00:13:59.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Poppy, those are your footprints.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.799" end="00:14:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, shoes must be clean at the dinner</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.499" end="00:14:02.499" style="s2">table you sit to eat. No running, no</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.199" end="00:14:05.399" style="s2">shouting, no mud.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.499" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can mud be eaten?</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.399" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mud certainly cannot eat.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll eat outside.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.899" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you can&#39;t keep letting her have</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.601" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">her way.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:29.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll eat here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.601" end="00:14:31.201" style="s2">So the carpet</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.849" end="00:14:34.301" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.201" end="00:14:34.301" style="s2">The carpet&#39;s already dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.501" end="00:14:40.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, do you want food next to the</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.201" end="00:14:40.601" style="s2">mud?</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.701" end="00:14:51.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll only take one small bite.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.701" end="00:14:51.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma&#39;s sitting on the carpet. Ew.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.601" end="00:14:56.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It tastes a little better than the</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:56.701" style="s2">rules.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.401" end="00:15:04.101" style="s2">She laughs just like Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.601" end="00:15:08.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does Mommy eat carpet food too?</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.601" end="00:15:21.901" style="s2">Daddy, did you forget how to sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.701" end="00:15:33.501" style="s2">Daddy, the bed is over there.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.901" end="00:15:36.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.801" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t sleep, I don&#39;t sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.701" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t a game.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.601" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. It&#39;s sleeping.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.601" end="00:15:52.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re in a state where you need a</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.801" end="00:15:55.501" style="s2">family therapist.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.801" end="00:15:57.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need someone studying my grief.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.501" end="00:15:59.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is isn&#39;t studying you. She is</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.201" end="00:16:02.401" style="s2">helping you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.701" end="00:16:02.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:11.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find this grown-up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.101" end="00:16:13.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.001" end="00:16:15.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Martha says if Daddy&#39;s got a big storm</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.001" end="00:16:16.301" style="s2">inside, he can find a grown-up with an</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.101" end="00:16:20.502" style="s2">umbrella.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.301" end="00:16:20.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you haven&#39;t slept properly in days.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.802" end="00:16:24.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If daddy won&#39;t sleep, Poppy stays up</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.102" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.302" end="00:16:27.096" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One session.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.702" end="00:16:29.116" style="s2">Only one.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.096" end="00:16:29.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.102" end="00:16:38.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy wants to listen too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.702" end="00:16:39.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Froggy can sit in the front row.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.602" end="00:16:41.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re here to tell me to let go of</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.802" end="00:16:42.402" style="s2">the past, you can leave.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.202" end="00:16:43.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to tell you to let go of</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.402" end="00:16:44.902" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.602" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">Think about the last time you actually</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.902" end="00:16:48.702" style="s2">wanted to wake up. What made you want</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:51.702" style="s2">to?</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.702" end="00:16:54.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because we have frog rice for breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.702" end="00:16:54.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we start there.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.602" end="00:17:00.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She stays.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.402" end="00:17:04.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fine. She can be here with you,</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.502" end="00:17:04.002" style="s2">but it&#39;s not her job to save you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.802" end="00:17:22.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s late.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:25.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not without you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.702" end="00:17:25.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.702" end="00:17:28.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.202" end="00:17:42.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t try so hard. Just sit with</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.702" end="00:17:43.702" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.402" end="00:17:45.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then?</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.702" end="00:17:48.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy knows a song.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.702" end="00:17:48.702" style="s2">Quack, quack.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.702" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She stayed all night.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.002" end="00:18:16.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, daddy. Breakfast together?</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.402" end="00:18:28.203" style="s2">Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.903" end="00:18:28.203" style="s2">do you know my birthday?</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.903" end="00:18:31.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t,</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.203" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">and I should.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.503" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you forget me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.303" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, I</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.203" end="00:18:46.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Martha?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.203" end="00:18:49.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her file used Claire&#39;s maiden name.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:51.803" style="s2">The notices never reached you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.603" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s an explanation,</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.803" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">not an excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.603" end="00:19:09.103" style="s2">I held you the day you were born.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.503" end="00:19:11.903" style="s2">I lost my way after Mum died,</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.103" end="00:19:11.903" style="s2">not my love for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.813" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.303" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we still have my birthday?</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.903" end="00:19:22.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.303" end="00:19:22.303" style="s2">I&#39;ll make the cake myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.303" end="00:19:34.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, did a truck hit our frog?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.303" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll ask the chef to fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.203" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you promised to make it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.203" end="00:19:50.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.203" end="00:19:59.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, he&#39;s sleepy like you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.803" end="00:20:06.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A very convincing sleepy frog, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.558" end="00:20:06.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.003" end="00:20:17.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make a wish.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.103" end="00:20:19.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish Daddy won&#39;t be so sleepy</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.903" end="00:20:23.203" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.603" end="00:20:23.203" style="s2">I wish Daddy will stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.805" end="00:20:29.705" style="s2">I wish you&#39;d still be here tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.605" end="00:20:35.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.205" end="00:20:35.205" style="s2">And I&#39;ll keep showing up.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.505" end="00:20:46.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve missed two sessions.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.005" end="00:20:46.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy needs me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.605" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does she need you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.205" end="00:20:58.205" style="s2">Or are you afraid she&#39;ll disappear?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:58.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost her once.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.705" end="00:21:12.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go talk to Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.205" end="00:21:15.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you need me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.405" end="00:21:15.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur can come get you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.105" end="00:21:30.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One hour. I&#39;ll be back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.805" end="00:21:30.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Take Froggy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.705" end="00:21:40.305" style="s2">You&#39;ll come back after, right?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.005" end="00:21:40.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I&#39;ll prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.105" end="00:21:49.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming to work too.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.505" end="00:21:49.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s safe in the lounge, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.605" end="00:21:54.005" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.105" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">Just</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.005" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">give me a second.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.905" end="00:22:12.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, relax. I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.975" end="00:22:15.605" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.405" end="00:22:15.605" style="s2">Blow the bubbles.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.705" end="00:22:22.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like Nora taught us?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.005" end="00:22:22.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. You&#39;ve got this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.406" end="00:22:34.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s begin.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.706" end="00:22:34.106" style="s2">If I need a break, I&#39;ll say so.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.606" end="00:22:54.006" style="s2">Poppy?</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.106" end="00:22:56.606" style="s2">Poppy?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.206" end="00:23:04.206" style="s2">Sir, I found Miss Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:13.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I brought Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.906" end="00:23:15.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t leave without telling anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.706" end="00:23:19.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left you a picture.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.906" end="00:23:19.906" style="s2">I wanted Mommy to know your home.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.906" end="00:23:25.706" style="s2">I said Mommy loved this place.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.606" end="00:23:27.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.706" end="00:23:29.606" style="s2">I kept away from it</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.406" end="00:23:32.406" style="s2">because it made me sad.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.606" end="00:23:34.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Mommy coming back?</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.406" end="00:23:36.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.206" end="00:23:36.706" style="s2">She died.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.506" end="00:23:44.006" style="s2">But we can remember her together.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.506" end="00:23:44.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s miss her together.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.406" end="00:23:46.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.006" end="00:23:53.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, crying makes you hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.406" end="00:23:57.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not tonight, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.121" end="00:23:57.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.106" end="00:24:02.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one spoon. I go first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.706" end="00:24:11.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mom always put too much pepper in</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.006" end="00:24:13.306" style="s2">soup.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.006" end="00:24:14.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was it good?</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.306" end="00:24:17.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:17.506" style="s2">I finished every bowl.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.606" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then finish mine. I helped make it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.507" end="00:24:47.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the west wing breaker just tripped.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.007" end="00:24:47.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will it stay dark?</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.507" end="00:24:57.507" style="s2">Why is this place always dark?</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.408" end="00:25:04.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t bear to see what was here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.307" end="00:25:04.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy&#39;s things.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.807" end="00:25:18.007" style="s2">She&#39;s smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.107" end="00:25:24.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She loved this house.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.908" end="00:25:27.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why hide it?</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.908" end="00:25:31.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s keep the lights on tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.807" end="00:25:31.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we live here together?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.807" end="00:25:37.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can try.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.207" end="00:25:37.007" style="s2">One day at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.707" end="00:25:44.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No breakfast until you say good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.607" end="00:25:50.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.607" end="00:25:50.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mouth said it, your eyes didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.107" end="00:25:57.507" style="s2">At the children&#39;s home, we said it so</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.607" end="00:26:00.408" style="s2">everyone knew we were okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.507" end="00:26:03.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if someone wasn&#39;t okay?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.408" end="00:26:05.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;d sit with them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.207" end="00:26:06.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.107" end="00:26:07.807" style="s2">I&#39;m glad you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.778" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.807" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a real one.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.607" end="00:26:22.707" style="s2">But he went back into the dark.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.908" end="00:26:29.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes getting better means resting,</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.807" end="00:26:29.107" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.607" end="00:26:36.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s eating with everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.709" end="00:26:40.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we should eat upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.209" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you said we&#39;d try.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.009" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can leave whenever you need to.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.009" end="00:26:50.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This egg is George the Frog.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.409" end="00:26:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; George looks like my manager.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.109" end="00:27:05.909" style="s2">Then George deserves a raise.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.509" end="00:27:06.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, are you joking?</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:09.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.909" end="00:27:09.909" style="s2">Your dad can be funny, too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.309" end="00:27:15.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, your smile looks so pretty in the</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.709" end="00:27:16.909" style="s2">glass.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.009" end="00:27:18.409" style="s2">Daddy, can you see how you&#39;re smiling</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.909" end="00:27:20.609" style="s2">right now?</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.409" end="00:27:22.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see. I almost forgot I know how to</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.609" end="00:27:24.609" style="s2">smile.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.009" end="00:27:25.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We did good today, didn&#39;t we?</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.609" end="00:27:27.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, we did.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.809" end="00:27:30.809" style="s2">Thank you for pushing me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.209" end="00:27:32.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s eat together always like this.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.809" end="00:27:35.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.909" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">One more try. Smile like you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.009" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">to Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.709" end="00:27:43.409" style="s2">Wasn&#39;t that right?</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.109" end="00:27:43.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The words were right. You look angry.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.609" end="00:27:48.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay there, sweetheart. There are</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.709" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">cables.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.209" end="00:27:54.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Froggy&#39;s making your face.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:55.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your step.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.209" end="00:27:58.509" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.509" end="00:27:58.509" style="s2">Even Froggy&#39;s frowning.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.784" end="00:28:00.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.709" end="00:28:11.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were smiling. Why are you sad now?</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.109" end="00:28:12.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy reminds me of your mum. I miss</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.009" end="00:28:14.409" style="s2">her, too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.009" end="00:28:16.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, does it hurt to miss mum? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.409" end="00:28:17.809" style="s2">here, and Froggy&#39;s here. We won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.909" end="00:28:20.409" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.809" end="00:28:22.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the real shot. Keep rolling.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.409" end="00:28:23.709" style="s2">She&#39;d have loved this, you, Froggy, this</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.609" end="00:28:25.609" style="s2">whole silly day.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.709" end="00:28:26.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy says don&#39;t be sad. We&#39;ll love you</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.609" end="00:28:28.009" style="s2">twice, one for mum.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.809" end="00:28:28.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got everything I need. I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.009" end="00:28:30.209" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.509" end="00:28:33.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;ve got you, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.209" end="00:28:37.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s smiling now somewhere. I I it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.010" end="00:28:38.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, frog castle today?</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.110" end="00:28:40.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet, sweetheart. I&#39;m still feeling</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.810" end="00:28:43.810" style="s2">sad.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.510" end="00:28:43.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I make you sad?</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.610" end="00:28:49.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; miss mom. didn&#39;t do anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.110" end="00:28:52.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; stay with Dad. Grandma will take you to</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.910" end="00:28:52.510" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.410" end="00:28:58.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I leave him a brick?</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.210" end="00:29:01.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave two.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.510" end="00:29:01.410" style="s2">I might build later.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.010" end="00:29:06.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daddy will be okay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.510" end="00:29:10.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sweet girl.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.710" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy feel better soon?</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.210" end="00:29:15.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; still wants to fix me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.210" end="00:29:16.910" style="s2">Claire, she&#39;s got your heart.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.410" end="00:29:18.010" style="s2">How do I tell her I need quiet without</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.910" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">scaring her?</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.010" end="00:29:22.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t have to hold it all in. She</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:24.510" style="s2">already loves you through it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.010" end="00:29:25.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be okay for her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.510" end="00:29:27.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a new day.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. She&#39;ll be back soon.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.810" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">Good morning, Claire. We&#39;ll be okay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.210" end="00:29:38.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora helped me make these cards.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.510" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A hug, quiet, a walk, or help.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.610" end="00:29:44.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which one do you want, Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.010" end="00:29:47.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I don&#39;t know what I need?</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.010" end="00:29:47.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can try one and see if it helps.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.310" end="00:29:53.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet first,</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.010" end="00:29:57.340" style="s2">then maybe a hug.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.610" end="00:29:57.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll wait for you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.340" end="00:30:00.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.995" end="00:30:00.015" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.310" end="00:30:03.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Reminder for tomorrow morning, the board</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.010" end="00:30:05.010" style="s2">meeting, 9:00 sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.710" end="00:30:06.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I don&#39;t have to figure this out</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.010" end="00:30:08.010" style="s2">all by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.510" end="00:30:09.610" style="s2">I need help at work, too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.010" end="00:30:11.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right to ask for help, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.610" end="00:30:13.210" style="s2">Everyone needs it sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.010" end="00:30:14.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, that card says help. Is that the</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.210" end="00:30:15.210" style="s2">one you need?</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.210" end="00:30:17.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.210" end="00:30:19.510" style="s2">Maybe that&#39;s the one I really need.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.110" end="00:30:20.910" style="s2">The board, the numbers.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:22.810" style="s2">I always carry them with me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.910" end="00:30:23.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll stay right here, Daddy, even when</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.810" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">you&#39;re quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:27.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to have all the answers</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:29.010" style="s2">today. Just being here is a start.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.010" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe the real help is</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.010" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">just being here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.410" end="00:30:37.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you still lead this company?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.610" end="00:30:37.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.412" end="00:30:38.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll lead</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.810" end="00:30:40.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; company</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.112" end="00:30:42.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and keep my treatment appointments.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.512" end="00:30:43.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re stepping back?</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.112" end="00:30:45.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll make the key decisions. My team</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.812" end="00:30:47.012" style="s2">will handle daily operations.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.312" end="00:30:49.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The plan covers both his work and</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.012" end="00:30:49.612" style="s2">treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.612" end="00:31:03.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They agreed to try the new schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.612" end="00:31:04.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was telling the truth scary?</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.612" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.912" end="00:31:08.812" style="s2">but I told them what I needed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:11.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you feel sad, can you still be my</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.812" end="00:31:14.312" style="s2">daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.112" end="00:31:14.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will always be your daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.712" end="00:31:24.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sadness doesn&#39;t take that away.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:25.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even when it hurts?</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.112" end="00:31:27.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even then.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.512" end="00:31:28.712" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.212" end="00:31:29.912" style="s2">You asked if I stopped being your dad on</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.712" end="00:31:32.112" style="s2">bad days.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.912" end="00:31:34.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You&#39;re my daddy even when</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.112" end="00:31:36.412" style="s2">you&#39;re tired.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.312" end="00:31:38.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even when I can&#39;t play?</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.412" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, but tell me so I don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.512" end="00:31:41.212" style="s2">guess.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:43.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.212" end="00:31:45.412" style="s2">I&#39;m tired today, and that meeting scared</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.212" end="00:31:45.412" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:50.012" style="s2">Tomorrow we&#39;ll draw with Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.112" end="00:31:53.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s go home. You can rest.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.412" end="00:31:58.312" style="s2">Can we draw mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.612" end="00:32:02.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Draw mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.712" end="00:32:03.812" style="s2">The sunset will be beautiful when we get</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:06.512" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.812" end="00:32:09.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we draw her smiling?</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.512" end="00:32:11.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, baby. We can draw her smile.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.512" end="00:32:13.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember how her smile looks.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.612" end="00:32:17.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember, too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.912" end="00:32:17.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will she see our picture?</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.512" end="00:32:21.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She always sees us.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.012" end="00:32:23.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.612" end="00:32:25.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.212" end="00:32:28.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Draw your family. Anyone you want can be</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.412" end="00:32:28.012" style="s2">in the picture.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.312" end="00:32:36.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Froggy counts, right?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.212" end="00:32:38.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he matters to you, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.212" end="00:32:38.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know how to draw your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.312" end="00:32:42.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.413" end="00:32:42.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can help. She had this hair clip.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.513" end="00:32:51.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember that clip.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.113" end="00:32:51.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can stop whenever you need.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.113" end="00:33:00.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it hard to draw mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.513" end="00:33:03.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember her.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.913" end="00:33:05.613" style="s2">I just can&#39;t get her face right.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.313" end="00:33:08.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a family picture now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.613" end="00:33:08.913" style="s2">Take your time both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.313" end="00:33:11.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I miss her.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.113" end="00:33:17.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.313" end="00:33:17.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have her eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.117" end="00:33:19.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.313" end="00:33:21.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll find her face.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.313" end="00:33:24.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.513" end="00:33:26.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you too, Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.113" end="00:33:28.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember mummy holding my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.913" end="00:33:30.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.313" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">And she laughed with her whole face.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.813" end="00:33:36.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need a perfect portrait.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.313" end="00:33:40.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid I&#39;ll get it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.213" end="00:33:40.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. We can try again.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.413" end="00:33:48.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She had this little dimple.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.313" end="00:33:48.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now she&#39;s in our picture.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.413" end="00:34:00.713" style="s2">Is your birthday next week?</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.113" end="00:34:04.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I completely forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.713" end="00:34:06.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy never let us forget birthdays.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.113" end="00:34:10.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been so hard without her.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.113" end="00:34:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we can celebrate together, just us.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.113" end="00:34:15.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;d love that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.113" end="00:34:18.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can bake a cake just like she did.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.913" end="00:34:21.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds wonderful, my little one.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.113" end="00:34:22.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Memories don&#39;t fade. They change shape.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.013" end="00:34:24.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.313" end="00:34:27.913" style="s2">They stay with us.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.413" end="00:34:29.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your birthday&#39;s next week.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.913" end="00:34:31.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t celebrated my birthday in a</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.713" end="00:34:34.013" style="s2">long time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.613" end="00:34:36.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because mummy isn&#39;t here?</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.013" end="00:34:38.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mom always planned it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.013" end="00:34:42.314" style="s2">I miss having her there.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.913" end="00:34:45.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to make it hurt more.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.314" end="00:34:47.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for asking first.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.014" end="00:34:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if we do something small?</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.914" end="00:34:52.114" style="s2">No big party, just us?</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.314" end="00:34:56.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds wonderful, Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:58.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.014" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">Just the two of us?</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.214" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.614" end="00:35:08.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy birthday early, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.114" end="00:35:08.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep this forever, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.614" end="00:35:13.214" style="s2">It&#39;s the best birthday I could ask for.</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.114" end="00:35:15.914" style="s2">A small party, just us.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.214" end="00:35:17.914" style="s2">That&#39;s all I need.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.914" end="00:35:20.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And cake?</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.914" end="00:35:23.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And cake.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.214" end="00:35:23.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy birthday, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.714" end="00:35:29.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did all these boxes come from?</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.714" end="00:35:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The staff wanted to wish you well.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.214" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can put them away. I made something</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:35.514" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.814" end="00:35:40.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are these pictures for?</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.514" end="00:35:40.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick one. We can walk, read, or hug.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.614" end="00:35:44.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are the best gifts I&#39;ve had in</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.914" end="00:35:49.014" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.814" end="00:35:49.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one means ask a grown-up for help.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.914" end="00:35:57.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she kept the one.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.214" end="00:36:05.214" style="s2">No, not again. The card.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.714" end="00:36:08.914" style="s2">It&#39;s still here. It&#39;s real. Call this</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.214" end="00:36:10.114" style="s2">number. She wrote it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.914" end="00:36:11.814" style="s2">I&#39;ve been carrying this alone for too</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.114" end="00:36:14.514" style="s2">long.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.814" end="00:36:15.614" style="s2">Maybe maybe I should call.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.514" end="00:36:18.314" style="s2">Tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.614" end="00:36:18.314" style="s2">I&#39;ll call tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.714" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">Mom, can you come over? I don&#39;t feel</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.014" end="00:36:29.214" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.914" end="00:36:29.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, can I come in?</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.614" end="00:36:32.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another nightmare.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.914" end="00:36:33.414" style="s2">I woke up, but I still can&#39;t catch my</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.214" end="00:36:37.014" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.414" end="00:36:37.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. Let&#39;s call Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.714" end="00:36:43.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, tell me what you&#39;re feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.414" end="00:36:46.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My heart&#39;s racing. My chest feels tight.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.616" end="00:36:46.416" style="s2">It&#39;s not getting better.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.216" end="00:36:53.916" style="s2">You&#39;re okay now. You can go home.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.716" end="00:36:56.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, we&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.916" end="00:36:58.116" style="s2">Daddy, you used it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.616" end="00:37:01.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.116" end="00:37:05.116" style="s2">I called grandma. She came with me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.716" end="00:37:05.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you scared when you called?</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.716" end="00:37:10.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.816" end="00:37:10.916" style="s2">But having someone there helped.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.216" end="00:37:16.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m proud of you, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.016" end="00:37:20.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay to ask for help.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.416" end="00:37:26.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you scared when you asked for help?</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:31.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.116" end="00:37:33.316" style="s2">I thought I couldn&#39;t breathe that night.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.316" end="00:37:35.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you asked for help. Write that down,</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:35.716" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.416" end="00:37:46.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can be scared and brave.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.516" end="00:37:48.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means I can be scared and still ask</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.516" end="00:37:48.916" style="s2">for help.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.016" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One small thing for yourself today.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.516" end="00:37:56.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll start with breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.116" end="00:38:04.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, then make mine too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.816" end="00:38:12.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How hard can pancakes be?</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.916" end="00:38:14.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, brave daddy. Let&#39;s go cook.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.916" end="00:38:16.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today,</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.116" end="00:38:16.916" style="s2">I think I can try.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.616" end="00:38:23.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, did you burn the breakfast?</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.616" end="00:38:30.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should leave this to the chef.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.616" end="00:38:30.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you&#39;d try.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.716" end="00:38:39.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Low heat, sir, and patience.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.216" end="00:38:43.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m better at contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.516" end="00:38:43.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pancakes don&#39;t sign contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.617" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not perfect, but edible.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.917" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one&#39;s good. You made it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.017" end="00:39:01.517" style="s2">Frog-shaped eggs tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.617" end="00:39:04.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we need groceries.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.117" end="00:39:06.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we go pick fresh berries for</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.817" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">tomorrow&#39;s pancake?</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.917" end="00:39:13.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The berry patch is ready, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.817" end="00:39:13.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds like a wonderful plan.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.717" end="00:39:19.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, just pick some milk.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.417" end="00:39:27.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know which one you like.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.717" end="00:39:27.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can ask me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.517" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopping for the family?</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.317" end="00:39:39.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Learning how.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.117" end="00:39:39.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s getting good at it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.317" end="00:39:49.717" style="s2">That frog isn&#39;t mine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.117" end="00:39:52.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s from the old nursery box we picked</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.717" end="00:39:52.117" style="s2">up today.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.217" end="00:40:04.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire sewed that patch.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.117" end="00:40:04.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it knew mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:16.117" style="s2">Was this mine?</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.017" end="00:40:25.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire fixed it before you were born.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:25.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She never threw broken things away.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.117" end="00:40:33.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read it, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.817" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t heard her words in years.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.117" end="00:40:40.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can read one line.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.817" end="00:40:40.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The little frog found his way home.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.117" end="00:40:51.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, did I do something</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.618" end="00:40:54.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.718" end="00:40:54.518" style="s2">I just need a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.718" end="00:41:11.818" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.118" end="00:41:13.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you like the story?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.818" end="00:41:16.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.218" end="00:41:16.218" style="s2">It just makes me miss mum.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.618" end="00:41:25.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have to finish.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.218" end="00:41:25.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe just the last line together.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.018" end="00:41:30.618" style="s2">The frog dad was sad and the little frog</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.218" end="00:41:33.618" style="s2">hugged him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.618" end="00:41:33.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I hug you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.818" end="00:41:36.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.818" end="00:41:43.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shall I put it away?</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.218" end="00:41:46.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it here.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.518" end="00:41:46.418" style="s2">I&#39;d like to read it again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.418" end="00:41:54.518" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. We&#39;ll hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.218" end="00:42:00.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the time you keep for yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.418" end="00:42:08.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought being there for Poppy meant</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.718" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">never leaving her side.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.318" end="00:42:12.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She needs a father who takes care of</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.718" end="00:42:12.518" style="s2">himself too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.718" end="00:42:17.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take my walk then we&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.318" end="00:42:19.518" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.418" end="00:42:21.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re better, will you still want me</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.518" end="00:42:21.918" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.818" end="00:42:28.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:47.818" style="s2">Poppy?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.318" end="00:42:51.318" style="s2">Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.818" end="00:42:51.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somewhere I won&#39;t bother you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.420" end="00:42:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you&#39;re bothering me?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.220" end="00:43:04.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you get better, you won&#39;t need me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.720" end="00:43:07.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I made you feel that way.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.220" end="00:43:09.920" style="s2">You&#39;re my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.820" end="00:43:13.320" style="s2">This is your home.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.920" end="00:43:14.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I can&#39;t make you better?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.320" end="00:43:17.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.520" end="00:43:17.820" style="s2">My doctors and I will work on that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.720" end="00:43:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I still help sometimes?</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.120" end="00:43:31.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can hug me,</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.320" end="00:43:31.420" style="s2">but you don&#39;t have to look after me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.120" end="00:43:40.420" style="s2">I&#39;ll go into the office tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.220" end="00:43:42.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.420" end="00:43:46.320" style="s2">my tummy hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.920" end="00:43:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me where. I&#39;ll get help.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.220" end="00:43:52.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m sick, you can&#39;t go to work.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.820" end="00:43:58.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home observation.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.120" end="00:44:02.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll keep checking your tummy. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.920" end="00:44:02.220" style="s2">scared about me going to work, too?</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.420" end="00:44:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m scared you won&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.520" end="00:44:09.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can tell me you&#39;re scared even when</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.920" end="00:44:11.520" style="s2">you&#39;re not sick.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.720" end="00:44:12.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5:00</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.520" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">And if plans change, I&#39;ll call.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.920" end="00:44:36.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll say I&#39;m scared next time.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.720" end="00:44:36.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;ll listen.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.520" end="00:44:42.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise we will?</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.320" end="00:44:48.620" style="s2">Five sharp, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.320" end="00:44:51.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.520" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more item, Mr. Hawthorn.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.121" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send it to my office. made a promise.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.421" end="00:45:06.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 4 59</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.421" end="00:45:10.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear a car, Miss Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.721" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.591" end="00:45:23.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.021" end="00:45:23.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really came back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.001" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:38.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow is another work day.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.121" end="00:45:41.621" style="s2">Same promise.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.321" end="00:45:41.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be here with Arthur.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.421" end="00:46:01.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.621" end="00:46:01.421" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.021" end="00:46:07.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said 5. I kept looking at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.721" end="00:46:09.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I should have called</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.721" end="00:46:10.521" style="s2">before 5.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.121" end="00:46:12.521" style="s2">The meeting ran late.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.521" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">I still should have called you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.521" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you forgot me again.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.921" end="00:46:22.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m delayed, I&#39;ll call you and Arthur</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.821" end="00:46:24.921" style="s2">before 5.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.121" end="00:46:27.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if you&#39;re busy?</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:27.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Especially then.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.221" end="00:46:31.021" style="s2">Arthur&#39;s in too.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.921" end="00:46:37.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I forgive you, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.821" end="00:46:43.121" style="s2">Papa,</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.321" end="00:46:46.121" style="s2">call me if you&#39;re late. I get scared.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.121" end="00:46:46.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t leave you guessing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.321" end="00:46:48.921" style="s2">We&#39;re okay now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.023" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want a present. Will you really</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.122" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">call next time?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.723" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.023" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">A present can&#39;t make up for scaring you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.823" end="00:47:14.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you weren&#39;t coming.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.823" end="00:47:23.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I set a reminder.</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.422" end="00:47:26.422" style="s2">I&#39;ll call before 5:00 if I&#39;m delayed.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.323" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if it happens again?</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.422" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur will help us keep in touch.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.523" end="00:47:35.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise you won&#39;t just say it?</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.723" end="00:47:38.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll show you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.422" end="00:47:47.323" style="s2">What&#39;s that behind your door?</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.523" end="00:48:00.523" style="s2">Did you make all these marks?</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.223" end="00:48:01.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t erase them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.523" end="00:48:04.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.823" end="00:48:04.523" style="s2">Tell me what they mean.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.723" end="00:48:10.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Black means nobody came. Green means you</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.422" end="00:48:10.723" style="s2">did.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.922" end="00:48:14.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lot of waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.823" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t want to forget which days you</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.723" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">came.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.323" end="00:48:24.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we mark today together?</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.023" end="00:48:29.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back and said sorry. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.823" end="00:48:29.323" style="s2">green.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.922" end="00:48:45.922" style="s2">Will you come get me after school, too?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.823" end="00:48:56.523" style="s2">How will I know you&#39;re coming back?</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.723" end="00:49:01.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; School ends at 3:30.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.922" end="00:49:04.424" style="s2">I&#39;ll be at this gate.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.024" end="00:49:04.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you can&#39;t come?</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.724" end="00:49:09.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll stay with you. Arthur is on your</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.624" end="00:49:12.924" style="s2">pickup list, too.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.224" end="00:49:12.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If plans change, we&#39;ll tell you first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.324" end="00:49:16.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to build a pond?</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.924" end="00:49:19.624" style="s2">A big one.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.424" end="00:49:40.424" style="s2">Daddy, meet my new friend.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.824" end="00:49:51.524" style="s2">Lily, tomorrow we finish our frog pond.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.324" end="00:49:59.124" style="s2">Lily, tomorrow we finish Auntie Fried.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.824" end="00:50:03.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had fun today.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.124" end="00:50:03.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The best. Lily can jump like a frog.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.224" end="00:50:10.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The school invited parents next Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.124" end="00:50:10.324" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask her if she wants me there.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:20.324" style="s2">Why am I so far away?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.224" end="00:50:22.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re waiting for me. I&#39;m playing with</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.324" end="00:50:22.724" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.924" end="00:50:30.524" style="s2">Come Friday,</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.724" end="00:50:30.524" style="s2">but let me do the game myself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.024" end="00:50:38.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I walk beside her?</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.324" end="00:50:41.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please wait at the finish line.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.324" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.824" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay. Let me try.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.524" end="00:51:01.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.924" end="00:51:01.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.924" end="00:51:08.325" style="s2">I did</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.325" end="00:51:08.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did. I&#39;m proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.125" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, do you have friends too?</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:17.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.725" end="00:51:30.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Hawthorn, you actually came.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.825" end="00:51:34.325" style="s2">It&#39;s been a while.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.325" end="00:51:34.325" style="s2">Two years. I kept inviting you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.325" end="00:51:41.525" style="s2">Remember the burgers you burnt?</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.725" end="00:51:47.355" style="s2">You called them smoked.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.925" end="00:51:49.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy cooks badly with friends too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.355" end="00:51:49.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.825" end="00:51:54.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come again next week.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.425" end="00:51:57.125" style="s2">No pressure.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.425" end="00:51:57.125" style="s2">Maybe I will.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.425" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.525" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.425" end="00:52:25.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are we leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:36.525" style="s2">Did I do something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.325" end="00:52:40.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.525" end="00:52:40.125" style="s2">This date reminds him of mum.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.725" end="00:52:44.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I was better.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.525" end="00:52:46.225" style="s2">Today I panicked again.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.925" end="00:52:49.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One hard day doesn&#39;t erase your</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.225" end="00:52:52.325" style="s2">progress. Are you safe tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.125" end="00:52:52.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Eleanor&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.925" end="00:52:57.825" style="s2">I&#39;m having a hard day. It&#39;s not because</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.725" end="00:53:01.625" style="s2">of you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.825" end="00:53:01.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I leave Froggy by your door?</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.225" end="00:53:04.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.327" end="00:53:16.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that mummy&#39;s gift?</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.927" end="00:53:25.327" style="s2">Mummy bought another one.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.527" end="00:53:27.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old one is too small now. Claire</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.327" end="00:53:31.127" style="s2">saved this one for when you grew.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.727" end="00:53:31.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t ready to open the box.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.527" end="00:53:37.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we open it together?</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.327" end="00:53:40.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.527" end="00:53:40.027" style="s2">Slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.127" end="00:53:48.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a letter.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.327" end="00:53:52.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s mom&#39;s handwriting.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.727" end="00:54:01.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to sit with you?</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.427" end="00:54:03.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.527" end="00:54:22.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready, daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.327" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.327" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">I&#39;ll try.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.227" end="00:54:33.527" style="s2">Keep our photos out. I want you to see</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.627" end="00:54:33.527" style="s2">how happy we are.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.227" end="00:54:39.427" style="s2">Tell Poppy she was loved from her very</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.827" end="00:54:43.227" style="s2">first day.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.427" end="00:54:43.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. You told me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.027" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When work slows down, take Poppy on a</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.727" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">trip. Make some memories together.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.727" end="00:54:52.527" style="s2">I think we can do that.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.727" end="00:55:01.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does that mean a trip with you?</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.027" end="00:55:03.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just us</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.427" end="00:55:03.927" style="s2">and Froggy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.327" end="00:55:12.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re coming?</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.328" end="00:55:15.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wouldn&#39;t miss it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.328" end="00:55:21.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if work calls you back?</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.128" end="00:55:26.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My team is covering work.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.028" end="00:55:28.928" style="s2">These two days are ours.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.428" end="00:55:31.428" style="s2">Here&#39;s our return ticket. Sunday evening</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.928" end="00:55:33.828" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.428" end="00:55:36.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together?</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.828" end="00:55:36.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.228" end="00:55:49.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frog trip starts now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.228" end="00:55:49.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All aboard, Captain Frog.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.928" end="00:56:00.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When we leave home, we come back, right?</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.928" end="00:56:00.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what home is for.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.028" end="00:56:15.328" style="s2">We come here to remember mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.628" end="00:56:15.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did we come here to find mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.628" end="00:56:18.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.228" end="00:56:21.228" style="s2">Mummy died.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.628" end="00:56:24.328" style="s2">We came to see a place she loved.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.228" end="00:56:24.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did we come?</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.528" end="00:56:31.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She loved this view.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.328" end="00:56:33.928" style="s2">We used to watch the sunset here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.828" end="00:56:35.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she laugh here?</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.928" end="00:56:38.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A lot.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.028" end="00:56:38.528" style="s2">Especially when I slipped on that dock.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.528" end="00:56:53.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then this is a happy place, too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.928" end="00:56:53.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It can be.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.528" end="00:57:00.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me a funny mummy story tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.328" end="00:57:00.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know just the one.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.228" end="00:57:05.628" style="s2">Your mother Claire was such a kind</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.728" end="00:57:09.028" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.628" end="00:57:09.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was mummy ever naughty?</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.274" end="00:57:12.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.628" end="00:57:15.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.329" end="00:57:18.129" style="s2">She stole cake at midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.029" end="00:57:18.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like a cake thief?</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.754" end="00:57:22.774" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.529" end="00:57:29.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And she was terrified of spiders.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.229" end="00:57:32.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But mummy was brave.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.129" end="00:57:32.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brave people get scared too.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.129" end="00:57:44.329" style="s2">She always shared the last cookie, just</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.229" end="00:57:47.429" style="s2">like you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.329" end="00:57:47.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I&#39;m like mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.929" end="00:57:57.729" style="s2">Do I do things like you too?</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.829" end="00:58:03.929" style="s2">When you look at me, do you see mummy?</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.329" end="00:58:10.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see you, Poppy, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.329" end="00:58:10.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I do things like mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.229" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You share cookies like her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.129" end="00:58:19.029" style="s2">You make terrible frog jokes like me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.029" end="00:58:21.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I can jump farther than both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.029" end="00:58:21.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.429" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This frog is you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.929" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.129" end="00:58:45.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.429" end="00:58:48.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to finish the paperwork so you</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.929" end="00:58:48.629" style="s2">can stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.729" end="00:58:53.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are they taking me away?</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.629" end="00:58:55.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.629" end="00:58:56.929" style="s2">You can live with me now. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.029" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">finishing the paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.929" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why do we need a judge?</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.229" end="00:59:05.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We corrected her family details and</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.729" end="00:59:07.229" style="s2">completed the home assessment.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.229" end="00:59:09.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in treatment and our care plan is in</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.229" end="00:59:09.629" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.829" end="00:59:18.131" style="s2">The The judge approved it. You can keep</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.631" end="00:59:21.531" style="s2">living with me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.131" end="00:59:21.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I can stay?</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.531" end="00:59:43.531" style="s2">What if somebody changes their mind?</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.631" end="00:59:46.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Going somewhere?</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.731" end="00:59:49.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just in case.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.531" end="00:59:54.731" style="s2">When grown-ups move my things, I usually</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.531" end="00:59:56.031" style="s2">have to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.731" end="00:59:58.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have told you before changing</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.031" end="00:59:58.431" style="s2">the room.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.631" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">Both rooms are yours to use. Nothing&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.531" end="01:00:20.231" style="s2">being packed to send you away.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.131" end="01:00:22.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I keep my suitcase?</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.231" end="01:00:22.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.631" end="01:00:34.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can take your time.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.031" end="01:00:39.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I can unpack today.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.931" end="01:00:44.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a charity gala tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.531" end="01:00:44.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, will you be scared of stage?</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.331" end="01:00:49.431" style="s2">Will you tell them you get sad</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.831" end="01:00:50.731" style="s2">sometimes?</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.431" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can keep it strictly about the</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.731" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">charity.</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.831" end="01:00:59.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Children need support.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.531" end="01:00:59.131" style="s2">So do the adults caring for them.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.131" end="01:01:04.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can tell them how you feel.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.931" end="01:01:10.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I&#39;m nervous?</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.231" end="01:01:10.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.132" end="01:01:31.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our project offers children safe spaces</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.332" end="01:01:34.332" style="s2">and families real support.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.032" end="01:01:34.332" style="s2">I know how much that matters.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.232" end="01:01:45.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were scared, weren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.377" end="01:01:46.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.632" end="01:01:49.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was,</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.932" end="01:01:49.832" style="s2">and I did it anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.532" end="01:01:58.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, she&#39;s scared.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.732" end="01:02:07.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m getting overwhelmed too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.032" end="01:02:07.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s move somewhere quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.332" end="01:02:22.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s give her space. Her mom&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.932" end="01:02:22.132" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.232" end="01:02:26.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.432" end="01:02:26.132" style="s2">She needs a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.432" end="01:02:43.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can come out when she&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.332" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.332" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">We&#39;ll wait here.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.232" end="01:02:54.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, do you help every kid now?</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.232" end="01:03:14.513" style="s2">Daddy can&#39;t only help other kids.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.493" end="01:03:14.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.532" end="01:03:21.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.032" end="01:03:26.133" style="s2">You knocked down his castle.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.533" end="01:03:26.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You smiled at him like you smile at me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.733" end="01:03:33.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me if you want me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.433" end="01:03:34.733" style="s2">Don&#39;t knock down his toys.</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.033" end="01:03:36.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he your kid now?</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.733" end="01:03:39.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You&#39;re my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.833" end="01:03:39.933" style="s2">Helping him doesn&#39;t change that.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.733" end="01:03:51.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I knocked it down. Can I help</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.933" end="01:03:54.633" style="s2">rebuild?</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.139" end="01:03:54.633" style="s2">[snorts] You can do the roof.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.033" end="01:04:09.933" style="s2">Then I need my own daddy time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.933" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">All day is daddy time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.033" end="01:04:24.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love being with you,</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.533" end="01:04:28.133" style="s2">but I still need to work and rest.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.033" end="01:04:28.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how do I know when it&#39;s my turn?</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.633" end="01:04:33.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can set aside a fixed half hour</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.133" end="01:04:33.033" style="s2">together every day.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.033" end="01:04:37.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half an hour after dinner, phones away,</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.633" end="01:04:40.033" style="s2">just us.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.833" end="01:04:41.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if you&#39;re late?</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.033" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you first and we&#39;ll pick a new</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.733" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.533" end="01:04:59.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You jump like a sleepy frog.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.333" end="01:04:59.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then teach me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.533" end="01:05:13.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, please remember to join the</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.033" end="01:05:18.033" style="s2">community nature day tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.833" end="01:05:18.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow we jump in real mud.</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.133" end="01:05:21.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mud</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.233" end="01:05:21.735" style="s2">in shoes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.335" end="01:05:29.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, froggy&#39;s stuck.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.735" end="01:05:36.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay still.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.935" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.035" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but froggy needs us.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.835" end="01:05:46.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.835" end="01:05:57.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s a mud frog.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.535" end="01:05:57.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now I need clean pants.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.135" end="01:06:12.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you playing in the mud with me</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.335" end="01:06:12.735" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.435" end="01:06:19.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.935" end="01:06:19.735" style="s2">Next time, I&#39;ll wear boots.</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.035" end="01:06:27.335" style="s2">I laughed yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.135" end="01:06:27.335" style="s2">Why do I feel low today?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.935" end="01:06:31.535" style="s2">I thought getting better meant feeling</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.335" end="01:06:33.435" style="s2">good every day.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.535" end="01:06:35.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some days will be harder. That doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.435" end="01:06:37.535" style="s2">mean you&#39;re back at the start.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.935" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">You&#39;re asking for help and keeping your</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.535" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">plans. Those are real changes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.935" end="01:06:46.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even on the hard days?</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.135" end="01:06:46.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Especially then.</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.035" end="01:06:50.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m tired today. I&#39;ll rest. You can go</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.435" end="01:06:54.335" style="s2">play.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.735" end="01:06:54.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I ask what you need?</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.135" end="01:07:06.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet first,</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.635" end="01:07:06.235" style="s2">then a hug.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.635" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s draw when you&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.135" end="01:07:29.336" style="s2">Wait. what time will you come out?</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.876" end="01:07:33.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.236" end="01:07:41.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need an hour of quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.736" end="01:07:41.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if you don&#39;t come out?</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.136" end="01:07:49.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At 11:00 I&#39;ll come out for a snack with</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.136" end="01:07:52.836" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.636" end="01:07:53.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if you need more rest?</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.836" end="01:07:56.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.236" end="01:07:56.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you before I go back in.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.336" end="01:08:07.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came out.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.736" end="01:08:11.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I would.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.836" end="01:08:16.736" style="s2">Is a hug next?</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.036" end="01:08:20.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only if you want one.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.836" end="01:08:32.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A moment, sweetheart. I stood up too</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.236" end="01:08:32.736" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.336" end="01:08:40.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I do something wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.036" end="01:08:41.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.336" end="01:08:44.436" style="s2">I&#39;m a little dizzy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.636" end="01:08:44.436" style="s2">I still want that hug.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.636" end="01:08:53.836" style="s2">I&#39;ll meet you in the sun room before</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.736" end="01:08:56.936" style="s2">lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.836" end="01:08:56.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll save you a seat.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.636" end="01:09:17.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I would love that hug.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.336" end="01:09:17.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came when you said.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.936" end="01:09:29.338" style="s2">Could I be your doctor, daddy?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.538" end="01:09:35.538" style="s2">Daddy, you need a rest.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.638" end="01:09:39.658" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.038" end="01:09:43.737" style="s2">I&#39;ll watch you all day so you get</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.838" end="01:09:45.538" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.737" end="01:09:47.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to be my doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.538" end="01:09:50.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has doctors to help him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.538" end="01:09:50.737" style="s2">You can play doctor for fun.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.338" end="01:09:59.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But who helps when I&#39;m scared?</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.338" end="01:09:59.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can tell your dad, teachers, or me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.218" end="01:10:03.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.438" end="01:10:11.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes I think daddy won&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.738" end="01:10:18.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for telling us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.938" end="01:10:21.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow we can talk about what scares</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.838" end="01:10:21.038" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.738" end="01:10:37.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The frog only stays in the little house</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.137" end="01:10:37.038" style="s2">for 10 seconds.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.438" end="01:10:43.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t take him away.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.637" end="01:10:45.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s stop.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.038" end="01:10:48.938" style="s2">Froggy [snorts] can stay with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.338" end="01:10:48.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if he never comes back?</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.338" end="01:10:53.838" style="s2">Maybe daddy didn&#39;t come before because I</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.438" end="01:10:55.137" style="s2">wasn&#39;t good.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.838" end="01:10:58.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.137" end="01:10:58.038" style="s2">You did nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.438" end="01:11:02.134" style="s2">The records were wrong. I didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.838" end="01:11:02.538" style="s2">where you were. That wasn&#39;t your fault.</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.134" end="01:11:05.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.538" end="01:11:06.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can stay even if I&#39;m not good?</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.038" end="01:11:08.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.238" end="01:11:08.938" style="s2">This is your home.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.038" end="01:11:16.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we talk about this together next</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.738" end="01:11:18.038" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.938" end="01:11:21.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.038" end="01:11:21.338" style="s2">We&#39;ll talk together next week.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.538" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">Today</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.738" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">draw a home together.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.739" end="01:11:42.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why such a high wall?</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.339" end="01:11:42.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So nobody can leave.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.439" end="01:11:48.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to go out sometimes, but I can</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.339" end="01:11:51.839" style="s2">tell you when I&#39;ll return.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.839" end="01:11:55.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if you&#39;re having a hard day?</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.839" end="01:11:55.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll ask grown-ups for help.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.539" end="01:12:03.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the door can open.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.639" end="01:12:06.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would help you feel safe?</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.039" end="01:12:06.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy telling me when he&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.939" end="01:12:16.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll meet your teacher tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.139" end="01:12:16.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t talk like you&#39;re at work.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.739" end="01:12:23.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will I need to book separately?</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.439" end="01:12:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No special treatment. I&#39;m here as her</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.339" end="01:12:26.739" style="s2">dad.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.839" end="01:12:28.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She often draws herself taking care of</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.739" end="01:12:29.239" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.039" end="01:12:30.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re helping her feel she doesn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.239" end="01:12:32.539" style="s2">to look after me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.539" end="01:12:34.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I&#39;m big, I&#39;ll keep Daddy safe</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.539" end="01:12:35.839" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.339" end="01:12:37.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can love me without looking after me</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.839" end="01:12:39.639" style="s2">all the time.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.439" end="01:12:41.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even when you&#39;re sad?</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.639" end="01:12:43.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go play and learn. You can choose what</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.539" end="01:12:47.039" style="s2">you want to be.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.639" end="01:12:48.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I want to be an explorer.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.039" end="01:12:52.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can lead her group tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.639" end="01:12:54.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only if Daddy stays where I can see him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.839" end="01:12:55.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I staying right where you can see</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.039" end="01:12:57.439" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.339" end="01:13:01.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a good kind of love.</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.439" end="01:13:04.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nature explorers, Saturday morning.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.139" end="01:13:05.239" style="s2">Maybe I&#39;ll explore with them someday.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.039" end="01:13:07.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to be the best little</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.239" end="01:13:09.839" style="s2">explorer.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.639" end="01:13:13.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a good dad.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.839" end="01:13:16.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, will you come explore with me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.039" end="01:13:18.539" style="s2">You make me feel safe, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.239" end="01:13:20.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see what she discovers tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.539" end="01:13:21.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you feel bad while I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.139" end="01:13:23.639" style="s2">exploring?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.639" end="01:13:25.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I need help, I&#39;ll ask an adult. You</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.639" end="01:13:28.739" style="s2">can go play.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.139" end="01:13:30.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t leave without telling me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.739" end="01:13:34.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll stay here until the activity ends.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.840" end="01:13:34.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy, we found a beetle.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.640" end="01:13:38.340" style="s2">Coming.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.940" end="01:13:52.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.140" end="01:13:55.040" style="s2">She&#39;s really exploring.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.240" end="01:13:59.340" style="s2">Maybe I needed this more than she did.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.040" end="01:13:59.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The book says it&#39;s a stag beetle light.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.140" end="01:14:07.740" style="s2">I watched the bugs, not you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.640" end="01:14:07.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I waited right here.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.340" end="01:14:12.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? I earned it all by myself.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.240" end="01:14:18.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give her a moment.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.740" end="01:14:21.540" style="s2">I&#39;m here, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.911" end="01:14:23.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.046" end="01:14:35.066" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.740" end="01:14:44.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t come up stage.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.340" end="01:14:47.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t need me to.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.840" end="01:14:47.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you were there.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.040" end="01:14:54.540" style="s2">Could other families come to our sunny</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.140" end="01:14:54.540" style="s2">room?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.940" end="01:14:57.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see what it would take.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.640" end="01:15:13.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can keep the books, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.840" end="01:15:16.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The family rooms stay private. Only this</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.740" end="01:15:16.540" style="s2">area opens.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.740" end="01:15:24.940" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.740" end="01:15:24.940" style="s2">Some memories are just ours.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.040" end="01:15:37.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we put Froggy by the reading corner?</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.927" end="01:15:40.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.042" end="01:15:40.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right where everyone can see him.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.542" end="01:15:49.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is crying aloud here?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.742" end="01:15:52.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You can ask for quiet or</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.742" end="01:15:52.342" style="s2">help, too.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.542" end="01:15:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not dark anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.942" end="01:16:01.642" style="s2">I like seeing people here again.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.942" end="01:16:01.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, you can be nervous.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.332" end="01:16:11.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.742" end="01:16:16.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a therapist,</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.442" end="01:16:19.742" style="s2">and I&#39;m not completely better.</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.842" end="01:16:19.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you speaking?</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.742" end="01:16:34.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I shut every door because I was ashamed</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.942" end="01:16:38.342" style="s2">to ask for help.</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.042" end="01:16:38.342" style="s2">Talking to one person was my first step.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.142" end="01:16:41.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.142" end="01:16:43.742" style="s2">book a consultation?</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.942" end="01:16:46.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. We&#39;ll speak privately</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.742" end="01:16:46.242" style="s2">afterward.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.642" end="01:16:55.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dad asked for help, too.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.642" end="01:17:00.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you felt you could ask.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.242" end="01:17:03.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.742" end="01:17:03.742" style="s2">You cured your daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.042" end="01:17:09.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made him eat.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.842" end="01:17:09.842" style="s2">I made him smile.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.142" end="01:17:17.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy,</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.042" end="01:17:21.142" style="s2">you helped me feel loved,</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.942" end="01:17:21.142" style="s2">but you didn&#39;t have to cure me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.442" end="01:17:27.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what if you get sad again?</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.742" end="01:17:30.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll talk to Nora, rest,</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.242" end="01:17:30.342" style="s2">and ask adults for help.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.942" end="01:17:33.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And me?</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.828" end="01:17:35.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.843" end="01:17:41.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.743" end="01:17:44.943" style="s2">You can love me and still go play.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.743" end="01:17:49.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we&#39;re going together?</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.043" end="01:17:52.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every day.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.743" end="01:18:05.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poppy?</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.543" end="01:18:08.843" style="s2">Marcus, check with her teacher.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.843" end="01:18:08.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll call the park office.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.543" end="01:18:22.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was by the nature table a minute</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.743" end="01:18:22.043" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.143" end="01:18:26.743" style="s2">Stay here in case she comes back.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.843" end="01:18:28.243" style="s2">Hello? My daughter Poppy is missing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.743" end="01:18:29.543" style="s2">She&#39;s four, curly brown hair, green</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.243" end="01:18:31.243" style="s2">overalls.</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.543" end="01:18:33.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We found her with a staff member by the</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.243" end="01:18:36.443" style="s2">nature table. She&#39;s at the visitor</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.043" end="01:18:36.443" style="s2">center now. She&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.543" end="01:18:43.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.543" end="01:18:45.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I got lost, so I found a uniformed</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.743" end="01:18:47.943" style="s2">helper.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.143" end="01:18:50.543" style="s2">I showed him my contact card.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.943" end="01:18:50.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was scared.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.843" end="01:18:54.943" style="s2">I&#39;m proud you asked for help. Next time,</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.443" end="01:18:58.643" style="s2">stay with the group.</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.943" end="01:18:58.643" style="s2">Tell an adult before you go anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.243" end="01:19:05.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time, I&#39;ll stay with my teacher.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.643" end="01:19:16.343" style="s2">Will you still be scared tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.443" end="01:19:21.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe a little.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.643" end="01:19:23.443" style="s2">I&#39;ll know what to do.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.843" end="01:19:25.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I&#39;m not scared at school</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.443" end="01:19:25.943" style="s2">anymore?</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.943" end="01:19:33.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be proud of you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.343" end="01:19:36.843" style="s2">I&#39;ll still be there to pick you up.</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.643" end="01:19:38.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you can have hard days?</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.843" end="01:19:41.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.143" end="01:19:41.445" style="s2">I know how ask for help now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.545" end="01:19:44.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can go play.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.945" end="01:19:50.445" style="s2">You&#39;ll come get me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.644" end="01:19:50.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, just like we planned.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.045" end="01:20:01.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See you tomorrow, daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.344" end="01:20:01.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See you tomorrow, Poppy.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.744" end="01:20:15.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, eat first.</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.925" end="01:20:19.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.045" end="01:20:21.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m thinking about your mom. I need a</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.844" end="01:20:25.445" style="s2">quiet minute.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.244" end="01:20:25.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll save you a seat.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.045" end="01:20:32.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready?</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.744" end="01:20:37.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.144" end="01:20:37.144" style="s2">I&#39;d like to join everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.744" end="01:20:49.344" style="s2">At Claire House, families can spend time</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.244" end="01:20:51.545" style="s2">together and find support when they need</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.344" end="01:20:51.545" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.445" end="01:20:57.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.744" end="01:21:01.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.844" end="01:21:01.244" style="s2">Now, let&#39;s eat together.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
